# Talus {{TAG}}

Prebuilt binaries for **AMD Strix Halo (gfx1151)**, Linux x86_64. Built from commit `{{COMMIT}}`.
gfx1151 is the only supported GPU target: the binaries carry GPU code for gfx1151 only.

## Supported models

One model runs at a time. Files, defaults and memory per model: [docs/MODELS.md](https://github.com/nsbradley88/talus-public/blob/{{TAG}}/docs/MODELS.md).

- Qwen3.8-27B (dense)
- Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (MoE)
- GLM-5.3-Flash (MoE, MLA attention)
- MiMo-V2.6-Flash (MoE)
- Laguna-S-2.1 (MoE, sliding-window attention)

The measured speeds and quality results of this release: [docs/RESULTS.md](https://github.com/nsbradley88/talus-public/blob/{{TAG}}/docs/RESULTS.md).

## Install

The guided installer takes these prebuilt programs instead of compiling when you name the release (it downloads the
tarball and checks its SHA-256); see [docs/INSTALL-GUIDED.md](https://github.com/nsbradley88/talus-public/blob/{{TAG}}/docs/INSTALL-GUIDED.md):

```sh
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nsbradley88/talus-public/{{TAG}}/install.sh | TALUS_RELEASE={{TAG}} bash
```

By hand:

```sh
curl -fLO https://github.com/nsbradley88/talus-public/releases/download/{{TAG}}/{{PKG}}.tar.gz
curl -fLO https://github.com/nsbradley88/talus-public/releases/download/{{TAG}}/{{PKG}}.tar.gz.sha256
sha256sum -c {{PKG}}.tar.gz.sha256
tar -xzf {{PKG}}.tar.gz
ln -s /path/to/your/rocm-sdk-root {{PKG}}/rocm-sdk   # or set LD_LIBRARY_PATH to its lib/, or use /opt/rocm
{{PKG}}/bin/talus-cli --help
```

## Requirements

- ROCm **{{ROCM_VERSION}}** (not bundled). The release was built and measured with it:
  `pip install --index-url https://nightly.repo.amd.com/rocm/whl-next/ "rocm[libraries,devel,device-gfx1151]=={{ROCM_VERSION}}"`
  The binaries need `libamdhip64.so.7`, `libhipblas.so.3`, `libhipblaslt.so.1`.
- glibc {{GLIBC_MIN}} or newer (Ubuntu 24.04+).
- A Strix Halo (Ryzen AI Max) system; see docs/MODELS.md for memory and kernel settings per model.

## What's in the tarball

`bin/` talus-cli, talus-server, talus-tui{{SETUP_BIN}} and libtalus_kernels.so (gfx1151) · `configs/` · `docs/` ·
`LICENSE`, `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`, `licenses/` (Rust crates, ggml, ROCm) · `MANIFEST.json` (commit, toolchains,
ROCm fingerprint, targets) · `SHA256SUMS`.

